wgf-autopilot 1
# The whole race on physics, on the glTF track, three laps, recorded by `wgf autopilot
# --record` (tools/drive.py typing into the record build's window: RACER_LAPS=3), then
# the results and Race again by Enter. Long: in a browser its default timeout grows with
# its frames (a headless browser here draws about 20 to 30 a second).
